Passage d22f21c3e519 (1). PC-Kappa gathered the humming Item-Epsilon close and spoke a low word of warding. Nobody laughed this time; the table had gone quiet around the dice. The torches of Place-Delta guttered as NPC-Gamma weighed the party in silence. A sentry fell from the wall and the courtyard answered with a long, ragged shout. PC-Kappa gathered the humming Item-Epsilon close and spoke a low word of warding. A sentry fell from the wall and the courtyard answered with a long, ragged shout. The gate stood open behind them and the road ahead was very quiet. They went on, slower now, each of them listening for the next sound in the dark.

