# KNOWLEDGE BASE (canonical lore — names, places, deities, NPCs, items)
# CANONICAL NAMES & TERMS (use these spellings exactly)

- **Place** (73×) — ## Place-Delta
- **Delta** (58×) — ## Place-Delta
- **Hold** (17×) — Allegiance: the Hold.
- **Item** (17×) — ## Item-Epsilon
